  "title": "Vion CMS working record draft schema v1",
  "description": "Proposed draft shapes only; semantic publish, relationship, route and media checks are defined in docs/IMPLEMENTATION_SPEC.md and docs/TAXONOMIES_AND_DAY_TRIPS.md. Published snapshots and asset stores are separate envelopes. Helper definitions (taxonomyTerm, taxonomyPublication, dayTripDefaults) are not record kinds.",
